00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:18.760
An astrophotographer assembled a view of the LEO triplet from more than 60 hours of exposure data

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:25.420
collected on a residential balcony. The image captures the gravitationally bound LEO triplet system

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:31.480
